{
  "case_id": "MEGAS-CANCEL-1.20.1",
  "title": "机械师立牌(megas)取消路径取证：真实入口 performSkillForCurio 开启目标选择会话后不消耗手牌、不写冷却（门控态 sel=1 / hand=4 / cd_rem=0）；cancel 关闭会话（sel=0）且手牌仍 4、冷却仍 0；等待 3.5s 后靶血量仍 500 => 取消路径未调度任何轰炸。",
  "version": "1.20.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "new",
    "ref": "megas_sign"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：机械师立牌(megas)「轨道轰炸 / 物资补充 / 精准打击」游戏内取证。\n本用例组由探针 megas* 系列驱动，**只调产品公开函数**（MegasSignItem / OrbitalBombardmentManager / PrecisionStrikeEffect / ModAttachments），断言锚定 latest.log 的 AP_<tag>_MEGAS 机器行。\n\n**期望值均按产品常量独立推算**（不读产品的中间量）：RADIUS=12、BASE_DAMAGE=2、MAX_STRIKES=10、\nPRECISION_THRESHOLD=6、COST_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER=1、STRIKE_INTERVAL=10t、FALL=8t、合计单轮约 18t；\n主动冷却 120s=2400t；被动间隔 1200t、阈值 6 张。\n  次数 strikes = min(floor(消耗卡牌数 / 2), 10)；\n  单轮伤害 = BASE(2) + 战斗牌费用总和 x1；若有「精准打击」则该轮再 + 当前层数；\n  总伤害 = strikes x per + (precision ? strikes x (strikes+1)/2 : 0)。\n\n**场景控制**：doMobSpawning false（仅本用例内，末尾恢复）避免自然刷怪混入目标池；\n探针读数里的 near（指定靶 12 格内存活实体数）恒应为 1 —— 若被污染则**响亮失败**，\n不把伤害平摊当成功。\n\nWARN 冷却写在 TargetSelectionAction#apply 内 => 只有 megascast confirm 档能验冷却；\nWARN 轰炸异步（每轮 10t 间隔 + 8t 下落）=> 伤害/层数必须在用例侧 wait 之后读。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..128]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "取消不消耗/不冷却：megascast select 走真实入口(performSkillForCurio) => 进入选择会话(sel=1)，\n  此时**不得**消耗手牌、**不得**写冷却（门控态）；随后 cancel => 会话关闭(sel=0)，手牌仍 4、冷却仍 0。\n  等待 3.5s 后复核靶血量仍 500 => 取消路径确实没有调度任何轰炸。\n  WARN 与 MEGAS-ACTIVE 的 confirm 档形成对照：同一入口 + 唯一差别是「确认 vs 取消」。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/give @s astral_dice:effect_card_hamburger 4",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasprep X0 500 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascd X1 fresh",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascast X2 select",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread X2 SELECTED",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megascast X3 cancel",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread X3 CANCELLED",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasread X4 AFTER",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe megasclear ZZ9",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doMobSpawning true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_X2_MEGAS:phase=SELECTED:equipped=1:hand=4:cd_end=0:cd_rem=0:[^\\n]*:sel=1:"
